  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Extraordinary Chambers in the Courts of Cambodia (ECCC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Extraordinary Chambers in the Courts of Cambodia (ECCC) is to prosecute the senior Khmer Rouge leaders and those most responsible for the atrocity crimes of the Pol Pot regime (1975-79). Part of the objective is also to provide rehabilitative victim support and media outreach for the purpose of national education. Thus, the ECCCis helping to ensure accountability for the atrocious crimes committed during the Khmer Rouge regime, to bring justice for the people of Cambodia, and to establish an invaluable historical record.</narrative>
  </description>
